nsed combined statements of operations, and will not recur in the income of the Company beyond 12 months after the ZentoAI Acquisition.\n(c) | Reflects the income tax effect of adjustment (a), calculated at the Macau complementary tax rate of 12%.","attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-043473","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-21","reportDate":"2026-09-21","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226043473/ex99-3.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/a48a6afb5100bb19bd047657dbe355d66dd8bc34efc6ac999154758379e61db3.bin","sha256":"a48a6afb5100bb19bd047657dbe355d66dd8bc34efc6ac999154758379e61db3"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"riskFactors":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"segmentIntelligence":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0}},"warnings":[]}]